    "created_at": "2025-12-10T09:21:47Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-12-10T09:21:47Z",
    "body": "The spec text is right. https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#html-fragment-parsing-algorithm is implicitly creating an inert document, by not assigning a BrowsingContext.\n\nWe have fixed implementations along the way. Thanks for filing this, Noam!",
